        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood BTB-RM3301, MegaTek Back-To-Back Shower Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 60 Inch MegaTek Pull Pair comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls with back to back mounting for a 1/2 inch thick glass doors. It is made out of stainless steel with a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rockwood MegaTek Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
